  (6020,'STAR WARS™ Jedi Knight - Jedi Academy™','Action','https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/6020/header.jpg?t=1741814908','https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/6020/57437/c80569120f019aef0bf2416d8643aaa4dcda5683/1750483717/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1462237022','Forge your weapon and follow the path of the Jedi Jedi Knight: Jedi Academy is the latest installment of the highly acclaimed Jedi Knight series. Take on the role of a new student eager to learn the ways of the Force from Jedi Master Luke Skywalker.','9,75€','16 Sep, 2009',81,'["Multi-player"]',unixepoch()),
