  (460920,'Steep™','Action','https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/460920/0e27cc9c517c046f3ce08e34253eca5d402b3177/header.jpg?t=1777994343','https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/460920/69757/75f12a6d6b5d9a143128380fae238bd00266aaf4/1750533534/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1471961584','Ride a massive open world across the Alps, where the powder is always fresh and the run never ends. Defy and master the mountain alone or with friends on skis, wingsuits, snowboards and paragliders. Record and share your best stunts.','29,99€','2 Dec, 2016',72,'["Multi-player"]',unixepoch()),
